<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USX-Marathon started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USX-Marathon started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of USX-Marathon Group with a market performer rating and a 12-month price target of $23 a share.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 21-5/8.</p>
</text>
